### D71.1 CPU wiring check (swegemma 0.2.11 / adk_submission 0.2.13 / google-adk 2.13.0, source-read on this VM, site-packages of /home/ubuntu/gemma-local/venv)
(a) YES, same Context, bound the same way as the analyzer's harness tools. The runner builds ONE dict of closures per task,
