plugins (agent_tool.py:265-277, include_plugins default True at l.149; adk_submission constructs it with defaults, resolvers/tools.py:116-117).
EventDisplayPlugin.on_event_callback (adk_eval_core/plugins/display_plugin.py:84-95) calls the runner's _on_event (agent_runner.py:660-665),
which calls trace.record_event + context.handle_adk_event, and that function counts each model-authored, non-pure-function-response
event as an LLM call (context.py:285-299; dedup by event id l.217-222). The analyzer sub-agent is counted the same way in arm 1.
Per gate invocation: EDIT_FIRST = 2 turns (run_command call, reply) + 1 tool call. SUBMIT = 3 turns (run_command call, submit_patch
call, reply) + 1 tool call. WORST CASE per task vs the builtin (2 EDIT_FIRST rounds then a submit): +3 tool calls (of 40), +7 turns (of 50).
