Every plain-string tool name in ANY agent YAML, root or agent_tool sub-agent, resolves from that one registry
(adk_submission/resolvers/tools.py:63-65). This is exactly how code_analyzer's read_file/graph tools are bound. So the gate's inner
`submit_patch` sets `ctx.submitted_patch` and `ctx.patch_submitted = True` on the task Context (execution.py:111-112), the same flag the
runner reads (agent_runner.py:859, 920, 1054).
